    <briefdescription>
<para>a performance estimator </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It records the time stamps a various time points (start and end of simulation) and calculates some performance figures. Optionally it provides a heart beat which periodically calls a functor If a cycle time is provides it calculates also the cycles per (wall clock) second </para>
    </detaileddescription>
